  "description": "The image of a car overturned on its roof, combined with the text 'this is what happens when you don't spank your kids,' is designed to evoke fear in the viewer. It uses the visual of a dangerous accident to suggest that not using corporal punishment leads to catastrophic outcomes, thereby instilling fear in parents who do not spank their children.",
